The Florida Rules of General Practice and Judicial 
Administration are hereby amended as reflected in the appendix to 
this opinion.  New language is indicated by underscoring; deletions 
are indicated by struck-through type.  The amendments shall 
become effective June 15, 2026, at 12:01 a.m.  Because the 
amendments were not published for comment previously, interested 
persons shall have 75 days from the date of this opinion in which to 
file comments with the Court.2 
 
 
